      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Let me tell you a story.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "A long time ago, before you and I existed, there was a great, big ball of light floating through the universe.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Let’s call him Nozomu.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Will you be able to remember that?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Well, not like it matters even if you don’t.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But let me get on with the story.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Nozomu drifted from place to place in search of anyone or anything.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But he found nothing.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "He was a lonely ball of light.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "In fact, he couldn’t even see his own aura since there were no structures for the light to bounce off of.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But anyway-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "One day, Nozomu learned how to open his mouth.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "He practiced speaking in the only way he could-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "He would scream.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "He’d scream so loud that, if anyone did exist, they’d likely tear their ears off in protest.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Kind of like that one guy, umm...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "What was his name again?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label chooseyourartist:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "menu:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Van Gogh",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Right! Van Gogh! That was the guy.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "jump correctartist",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Picasso",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Hmm...No, that’s not it. I think it was some other guy. Try again.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "jump chooseyourartist",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Dali",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Hmm...No. It’s not Dali. Maybe someone else?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "jump chooseyourartist",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label correctartist:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Well anyway, in the midst of his screaming, Nozomu learned he had a secret power.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "This power, which is still coveted by many to this day, would let him create objects out of thin air.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And so, logically, his first invention was a fleshlight.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Nozomu would fuck the fleshy object with his giant light-penis from dusk 'til dawn until he had no energy left in his body.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But one day, after fucking the fleshlight for the 6,425,873,826th time, he had a thought.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It was a wonderful thought.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "He thought-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "What if someone else existed?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And that’s when you and I were born.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Well, not right then, but some time after.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "In fact, billions and billions of people were born between then and now.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Nozomu used his secret power to create humans, so he could fuck them instead of the fleshlight.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "That’s when the humans learned that they could also fuck each other.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And so, in this new world where everyone fucked everyone else, some rules needed to be put in place.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And that’s when Nozomu stepped in once again.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "So, in his strange light-voice he shouted to all of his children-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Thou shalt not fuck each other anymore!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But language wasn’t invented yet, so no one understood him.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "So Nozomu created language- and people understood him this time.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But they didn’t want to listen.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "So they started making their own languages and writing their own rules of who it was okay to fuck and when.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But why didn’t those people listen to Nozomu? Especially after he gifted them with the ability of free thought and lust?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Well, that’s because all creatures are inherently curious.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And that goes for you and I as well, of course.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "For example, when was it you first learned to touch yourself?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The good old days, right? When we were still trying to make sense of everything.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But now we’re getting older. And it feels like we’re approaching death so quickly that we may not even live to see our children's seventh birthday.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Life is a horrible thing.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And we owe it all to Nozomu.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Because, you see, that horny light creature is actually who we call God now.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And the only reason we’re here today is because God got bored of fucking the same fleshlight over and over again.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It’s a true story. Ask your history professor.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "So, now that you know the origin of the universe, you’re free to believe pretty much whatever you want.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "What’s that?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "You’re tired of staring at this black screen?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Well, don’t blame me.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Blame the light that abandoned all of us.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "God is dead.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And he will never be back.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "So it is up to you and I to write a new world.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "A beautiful world.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "A world where our thoughts never reach the point of no return-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Where death isn’t an idea that crosses our minds each time we see a childhood memento.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "A world where we know that we’ll live to see our childrens’ seventh birthdays.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "A world with just us.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Come.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Rewrite it all with me.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "We will fix this world together.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Just you and me.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The way it’s always been.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The way it always will be.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I love you so much.",
      "zh": ""
